  "L4 variant (parity-l4-20261111-01): backend terms from the judged CPU run of physical_p4_kv1p5_kleak_dense.json (/mnt/workspaces/Cells/parity-rung2-4-20261109-03/p4kv/run/layout) and two blind L4 runs (/mnt/workspaces/Cells/parity-l4-20261111-01/blind-A/p4-kv1p5-kleak/run, /mnt/workspaces/Cells/parity-l4-20261111-01/blind-B/p4-kv1p5-kleak/run) from snapshot c819a4e41e5f61829ee604cfc3081f75408c0da2; the backend term also contains any engine difference between the two snapshots (the engine commits in between are recorded as leaving default trajectories unchanged).",
